# /navigation/navigate  (doc section 4.3)
# Semantic goal: "stand approach_distance metres in front of the named object".
# class_name must exist in slam/maps/<map>/semantic.yaml (case-insensitive).
# The call returns immediately once the goal is ACCEPTED; progress is reported
# on /navigation/status (PLANNING / FOLLOWING / RECOVERING / SUCCESS / FAILURE).
string class_name
float32 approach_distance
---
bool success
string message
